```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  actor Analyst
  participant UI as Streamlit UI
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant KB as Versioned Policy Store
  participant Rules as Deterministic Engine
  participant LLM as Optional Provider
  participant DB as SQLite
  Analyst->>UI: Submit request, response, facts, mode
  UI->>Analyst: Show external-transfer warning if LLM mode
  UI->>API: POST /api/audit
  API->>KB: Retrieve active/effective policy sections
  API->>Rules: Run facts, policy, privacy, hard-stop, escalation checks
  alt LLM/hybrid selected and configured
    API->>LLM: Send untrusted content with bounded judge prompt
    LLM-->>API: Strict typed JSON judgment
    API->>API: Verify cited passages; preserve deterministic hard stops
  else Offline or provider unavailable
    API->>API: Use deterministic result / transparent fallback
  end
  API->>DB: Persist result, config snapshot, provenance
  API-->>UI: Explainable score, evidence, decision, uncertainty
  UI-->>Analyst: Display review, export, or record human annotation
```
